From 53c1f63d2306d5c52d40d6aa7d7e03f4a793d9b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diljit Singh <address-in-upstream-commit@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:47:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] wifi: apple: centauri: retain ownership across failed
 suspend

Capture disconnect errors before transport teardown and propagate them from
cfg80211 suspend. Separate Bluetooth producer quiescence from coherent arena
release and register a recovery owner before publishing DMA addresses.

Retain original device/domain/allocation ownership across unbind, fence every
function before freeing or removing the endpoint, and recover aborted suspend
even when Control suspend never ran. Serialize F0 tuple access with remove and
keep new recovery generations from being lost behind running work.

Add production-source host tests with runtime failure controls for receipts,
Bluetooth registration/release and recovery/refusal ordering. These checks do
not establish firmware sleep or wake-event attribution.
